content:
@ppifylab eta ekta scammer der compnay… Initially ami arekjaegae valo position e job kortam.. To tara protome bollo salary je structure e dibe probation period pore tara tarar commitment theke sore jae.. Team lead theke valo review jabar poreo bole tmr performance valo na tai tmre commited salary dea jabe naa…. Eta shudu ekjon er shate kore nai oneker shate kore… 6 digit salary bole ene pore 20-30K automatic komae dey…
C3O hocche foul ekta public… Biye kamla *****… biye kore lukaia office er needy female employee der biyer prostab dey.. Lukaia biye kore pore bole ore naki jin e dorse… ekhono mone hoy arekta biye korar plan kortese.. Sob mialaia 4-5 ta biye hobe korse… he is a complete worshiper of lust…
Ekhon ashi management er kothae…. Management bolte kichu nai ja exist kore sob chaos… Eta ekta software firm na pura garments… bosti marka behave… employee der kono reason chara ber kore dey eder oneker dush just C3O er esob akam kukam kore jene gese…. Leadership, talent ei jinishgulor kono value nai… era ki poriman bosti marka behave kore employee jara ase tara valo bolte parbe… Er moddhe ex employee der eder management er lok kukur munib bole address kore… na ache professionalism na ache na ache kono ethics… Moreover share holder der shateo fraud kore… mane ki bolbo linkdIn e jaia pura pir baba saje ar vitore asto ekta vondo
